@prefix gp: <https://ggen.dev/ns/pack#> .

# Qualification-only external fact identity. The canonical profile
# individual is owned by ggen-pack-spec-pack: gp:Core1 a gp:Profile
# (GGEN-PACK-CORE-1, RFC §12.1). This fixture restates only that typed
# identity so the pack header's gp:profile reference resolves when
# swe-prometheus-governance-pack is qualified in isolation (cross-pack
# lint law; SLP-QUAL-001 precedent, standing-ladder-pack). It grants no
# standing.

gp:Core1 a gp:Profile .
